            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion!\r\n\r\nNo, this is not planned. For at least these reasons:\r\n- It will introduce too much new code to deal with not fixed opening position.\r\n- Having it at the bottom means that top part of the windows will either be not aligned or have different row relative to editor. Which is not good.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
